# Developer — Local Configuration Template

Copy this file to `DEVELOPER.local.md` and fill in your details.
`DEVELOPER.local.md` is gitignored and should never be committed.

## Apple Developer Account

- **Apple ID:** your-apple-id@example.com
- **Team ID:** XXXXXXXXXX
- **Signing cert:** Apple Development: Your Name (XXXXXXXXXX)
- **Bundle ID:** `com.victorrodrigues.siloquy`

For notarized distribution (outside App Store), a **Developer ID Application** certificate is needed.
The Apple Development cert is sufficient for local builds via `make local`.

## Support Email

- **Public support address:** support@yourdomain.com
